{"text": "Leaving the hall, I climbed a hill and looked out over a world that had become one great garden, without fences or signs of work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were no small houses anywhere, and the men and women looked and dressed so much alike that I could hardly tell them apart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sitting on a seat of yellow metal as the sun went down, I thought about why mankind had become so weak and gentle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Long ago, I guessed, people had conquered nature and made life perfectly safe, so there was no more need for strength or courage. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The struggle having ended, their bodies and minds had slowly grown soft, and this, I thought, was the sunset of mankind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The moon was rising when I came down the hill, and I looked toward the little lawn where I had left my machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The lawn was there, and the white sphinx gleamed in the moonlight, but the Time Machine was gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I ran wildly around the sphinx and through the bushes, but there was no sign of the machine anywhere, and a terrible fear seized me.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "e", "a", "v", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "I", " ", "c", "l", "i", "m", "b", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "h", "i", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "w", "o", "r", "l", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "b", "e", "c", "o", "m", "e", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ",", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", "o", "u", "t", " ", "f", "e", "n", "c", "e", "s", " ", "o", "r", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "n", "